  "notes": "A Discussion answers a deferred input. If the full pre-hook message is no longer at its position and has no unique equal match, every message the generation hook left is protected from reduction. Memory compaction receives an empty history; a returned summary joins ahead of the protected context. Redacted input is never reconstructed.",
